# ==============================================================================
# Makefile for Pac-Man Project
#
# Responsibility:
# - Automate everyday developer tasks:
#   * install: Install project dependencies (e.g., using pip / uv / pipx).
#   * run: Execute the game with default config (python3 pac-man.py config.json).
#   * debug: Run main script in debug mode using pdb.
#   * clean: Remove temporary files, __pycache__, and .mypy_cache.
#   * lint: Run flake8 . and mypy with all subject-mandated flags.
#   * lint-strict: Run flake8 . and mypy . --strict.
#
# Assigned Developer:
# - P2
# ==============================================================================
